  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋\" width=\"100%\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=請我喝咖啡&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=成為贊助者&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;label=加入Discord社群&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入Discord社群\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=維基百科&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基百科\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋》是一個添加養蜂人小屋結構的小型擴充包。該結構可以在草原和繁花森林生態域中找到。您可以查看<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基頁面</a>獲取更多關於養蜂人的資訊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fimages%252fbeekeeper_hut1.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" alt=\"養蜂人小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fimages%252fbeekeeper_hut2.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" alt=\"養蜂人小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他擴充包/數據包</span></p><hr><ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 花朵哞菇</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容數據包</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的Discord社群</a>交流、分享創作、提問，或隨時掌握模組最新開發動態與發布通知。也請不吝<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過GitHub回報崩潰或錯誤</a>。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">開發模組是我的興趣，無論有無支持我都會持續進行。但若您願意支持，可以透過<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>贊助。您的每一份支持都讓我衷心感謝。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權條款</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>授權。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎參考我的程式碼來學習解決問題的方法，或將片段應用於您的專案中。也歡迎將本模組用於任何模組包（若能在使用時標註來源或連結至此頁面將不勝感激）。</span></p>",
